# docs/tasks — numbered briefs, and the queue a harness reads

Numbered briefs (0001-, 0002-, ...), each the spec and reasoning for
one piece of work, committed on the branch that implements it. The
top level is the open-work queue: header of Key: value lines, blank
line, then the brief. Header keys and their rules are AGENTS.md's
"Tasks and the queue" section — including the parser-ordering fact
(single-line keys above any wrapped value). done/ holds completed
briefs once their work merges; numbers are allocated by checking
this directory including done/ at write time.
